    "updated_at": "2023-07-17T08:20:11Z",
    "body": "Hi @hknclk \r\n\r\nIf your Postman collection doesn't have responses Akto will hit those APIs to generate responses.\r\nSince the collections are being created but no endpoints are being shown, can you please confirm if those APIs are accessible from Akto dashboard server.\r\n\r\nReasons why it is not accessible:\r\n\r\n1. APIs are internal\r\n2. Akto dashboard server has no internet connection",
