    "created_at": "2023-07-17T08:36:31Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-07-17T08:40:01Z",
    "body": "Hi @Alucard23890 \r\n\r\nI've reviewed your Postman collection and noticed that all the endpoints are returning 5xx status codes. However, Akto, only processes APIs that return 2xx response codes. It would be great if you could update the endpoints to return the appropriate 2xx response codes so that Akto can process them correctly.\r\n\r\nAfter manually changing the Postman file to 200 status code, I can see 2000 endpoints [Image attached]\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1341\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/akto-api-security/akto/assets/91518451/b64156e2-3b17-464f-bdf9-1eb3775e1b1c\">\r\n",
